<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gap raised to attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gap raised to attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber upgraded Gap Inc to attractive from neutral, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 27-1/2 Wednesday.</p>
